Subject: [PATCH] fix(tui): backport bounded retained inline viewport

Backport 51f42336f8cffc1d42f7260609703cff0e41931d onto the pinned 1.4.0 runtime. Preserve its blocked/overlay and output handling, versions, dependencies and model catalog. Include effective-height snapshots, coherent dispatch frames and all 27 adapter/host regressions.
